# Generated by scripts/generate_mastermind.py: the whole vault concatenated into one file
# for pasting into another AI. Deliberately NOT tracked - it duplicates bodyweight,
# nutrition and per-course grades into a single blob, and a committed copy would go stale
# while still claiming to be "the absolute source of truth". Regenerate it on demand.
Mastermind.md

# Tool cache from the graphify skill: an AST index and content-hashed blobs regenerated on
# demand. Not project content, and it churns on every file change.
graphify-out/

# Source documents that must never be committed: saved DARS audits (student ID, high school,
# full grade history) and anything else downloaded to be parsed rather than kept.
# `scripts/parse_dars.py` derives `context/01_engineering/degree_audit.md` from one and the
# site reads only that. The name patterns stay as a second line of defence in case a file is
# ever saved outside this folder.
/private/
DARS*.html
*Audit Results Tab_files/

# Reference art dropped in the root to describe what something should look like. It is other
# people's work — the muscle chart is stock anatomical art and the exercise loop belongs to a
# commercial training app — so it is looked at and not shipped. `muscle-map.tsx` is drawn from
# scratch and `how-to.ts` is written rather than sourced, precisely so nothing here has to be
